window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>ASH: Lila comes into my life by chance, a blown tire, and a twist of fate.</p> <p>A masterpiece of unruly auburn curls, fiery eyes, and a spirit that can set the world ablaze. She is also the unfortunate driver I have to exploit to make my escape.</p> <p>I've been many things in my life—convict, murderer, psychopath. But the one thing I've never been is attached. She is supposed to be a means to an end. A less conspicuous way to travel. But amidst the chaos, we find a twisted serenity in each other's arms, making me want to keep her forever... if we can survive this.</p> <p>LILA: Ash is a nightmare brought to life—a killer, a psychopath.</p> <p>Muscular, tattooed, cold-eyed, with a darkness that can make anyone's blood run cold. He is also my unwanted companion on a cross-country road trip from hell. I see the darkness in him and witness it firsthand. But the longer I spend with him, the more I find myself drawn to him, against all my better judgment. He is the only man to ignite feelings in me I never knew I was capable of.</p> <p>His touch is fire, his words a twisted comfort. But how do you fall for a man you shouldn't trust? Carjacked is a dark hitchhiker romance with heavy subjects that some listeners may find triggering. A full list of the warnings will be found in the book. This story has no cliffhanger and ends with a HEA.</p>"; 
